* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py
.model nch nmos
.model pch pmos

.subckt dut VDD VSS VB3 VB1 VB2 VREF VB4 IBUF VIN VOUT
CL VOUT net6 1p
M1 VT VB2 VSS VSS nch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
